# Basic Test Guidelines

This document provides a comprehensive guide for creating unit tests in the ${PROJECT_NAME} project.

## Naming Conventions

- Test files must end with `_test.go`
- Same directory as the tested source file: `filename.go` -> `filename_test.go`
- test case name use underscore separated format
  for example:
  "successful initialization" → "successful_initialization"
  "double initialization fails" → "double_initialization_fails"
  "get notification before initialization fails" → "get_notification_before_initialization_fails"

